  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening national capacities in Palestine to fight illicit trafficking of cultural properties, and support Palestinian museums</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity aims to orchestrate national efforts in Palestine to fight against illicit trafficking of cultural properties, corresponding to the provisions of the 1970 Convention on the Means of Prohibiting and Preventing the Illicit Import, Export and Transfer of Ownership of Cultural Property, in addition to supporting national authorities in the operationalization and sustainable management of Palestinian museums in the West Bank and the Gaza Strip.</narrative>
  </description>
